<title>USA: Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freddie Mac revised short-term discount note rates Monday as follows:</p>
<p> -		 MATURITY--RATE</p>
<p> -		Overnight--5.10</p>
<p> -		   Dec 18--5.12</p>
<p> -		Dec 27-31--5.16</p>
<p> -		  Jan 3,8--5.25</p>
<p> -		   Jan 14--5.29</p>
<p> -Jan 16,22,23,29,30,31--5.25</p>
<p> -		   Feb 13--5.23</p>
<p> -		   Mar 10--5.19</p>
</text>
